001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     QUOTEXP.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400 INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   OCTOBER 1984.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.
001900*             PRINTS QUOTE EXPIRATION REPORTS.
002000*
002100***************************************************************
002200***************************************************************
002300***                   Q U O T E X P                         ***
002400***                                                         ***
002500***      THIS PROGRAM PRINTS 3 OF THE REPORTS AVAILABLE     ***
002600***      FROM THE QUOTE REPORT MENU.                        ***
002700***      PURCHASING MENU:                                   ***
002800***         1.  EXPIRING QUOTES                (REPORT QR4) ***
002900***         2.  QUOTES WITH NO EXPIRATION DATE (REPORT QR6) ***
003000***         3.  QUOTES WITH NO QUOTE NUMBER    (REPORT QR7) ***
003100***                                                         ***
003200***      THE USER INPUTS 3 OPTIONS BEFORE PRINTING BEGINS:  ***
003300***         1.  REPORT NUMBER                               ***
003400***         2.  NUMBER OF DAYS THE REPORT WILL              ***
003500***             COVER (UP TO 999 DAYS)                      ***
003600***         3.  SORT OPTION                                 ***
003700***              A)  QUOTE NUMBER                           ***
003800***              B)  EXPIRATION DATE                        ***
003900***              C)  VENDOR CODE                            ***
004000***                                                         ***
004100***************************************************************
004200***************************************************************
      *C  09/17/96  WL  MCINTYRE
      *C    MAKE REVISIONS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPATABILITY
      *C
004300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
