030000**************************************************************
030100**************************************************************
030200*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
030300*                                                            *
030400*    READ THE USER OPTIONS TO DETERMINE THE RANGE OF QUOTES  *
030500*    TO RETRIEVE FROM THE DATASET DVENDITM.  SORT THE        *
030600*    QUOTES IN THE ORDER THE USER REQUESTED AND PRINT THE    *
030700*    REPORT TO DISC.                                         *
030800*                                                           *
030900*       SORT OPTIONS ARE:                                   *
031000*            1 = SORTED BY QUOTE NUMBER                     *
031100*            2 = SORTED BY EXPIRATION DATE                  *
031200*            3 = SORTED BY VENDOR CODE                      *
031300*                                                  *
031400*    IF THE REPORT IS NO EXPIRATION DATE (3) OR    *
031500*    NO QUOTE NUMBER (4), THEN THE SORT OPTION     *
031600*    IS ALWAYS 3.                                  *
031700**************************************************************
031800**************************************************************
031900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA ACCEPT-DATA.
032000 000-START SECTION 01.
032100 00-MAIN.
032200     PERFORM 100-READ-OPTIONS THRU 199-EXIT.
032300
032400     IF OPTION-SORT = 1
032500        SORT SORT-FILE  ASCENDING KEY           SORT-QUOTE
032600             INPUT  PROCEDURE IS 200-PROCESS-QUOTES
032700             OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 300-PRINT-REPORT
032800     ELSE
032900       IF OPTION-SORT = 2
033000          SORT SORT-FILE  ASCENDING KEY         SORT-EXP-DATE-CN
033100               INPUT  PROCEDURE IS 200-PROCESS-QUOTES
033200               OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 300-PRINT-REPORT
033300     ELSE
033400       IF OPTION-SORT = 3
033500          SORT SORT-FILE  ASCENDING KEY         SORT-VENCODE
033600               INPUT  PROCEDURE IS 200-PROCESS-QUOTES
033700               OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 300-PRINT-REPORT.
033800
033900*----------  PRINT REPORT, CLOSE FILES, AND QUIT
034000*    IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
034100*        NEXT SENTENCE
034200*    ELSE
034300*        WRITE PRT-REC FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
034400*        WRITE PRT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-60 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
035000
035100     CLOSE PRT-FILE.
035200     CLOSE DVENDOR-I DVENDITM-I DDESC-I MBUYER-I.
035300     GOBACK.
035400*************************************************************
035500*************************************************************
035600*    READ THE USER OPTIONS AND DETERMINE WHICH REPORT IS    *
035700*  REQUESTED.  IF REPORT 3 OR 4 IS REQUESTED, THE COMPARE   *
035800*  DATE IS NOT NEEDED, SO THAT PROCESSING IS SKIPPED.       *
035900*                                                           *
036000*    IF REPORT 1 IS REQUESTED, THE COMPARE DATE IS COMPUTED.*
036100*  THE NUMBER OF DAYS MUST BE ADDED TO TODAYS JULIAN DATE   *
036200*  AND THE YEAR, MONTH, AND DAY MUST BE COMPUTED FROM THAT  *
036300*  TO DETERMINE THE COMPARE DATE.  THIS COMPARE DATE IS THE *
036400*  THE FINAL EXPIRATION DATE WANTED.  ANY QUOTES FOUND      *
036500*  THAT HAVE AN EXPIRATION DATE THAT IS BEFORE THIS COMPARE *
036600*  DATE WILL BE PRINTED ON THE REPORT.                      *
036700*************************************************************
036800*************************************************************
036900 100-READ-OPTIONS.
037000     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
037100     MOVE CHAR-1636PI     TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
037200     MOVE CHAR-10PI       TO NORMAL-PRINT.
037300     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-61 TO ESC-TEXT-61.
037400     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-60 TO ESC-TEXT-60.
032600
033300*----------  PRINT HEADER PAGE
078400*----------  OPEN OUTPUT FILE
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"       TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
028100     MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"      TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
037800
037900*----------  GET USER OPTIONS
038400     IF OPTION-REPORT = 77
038500        MOVE 3 TO WHICH-REPORT
              MOVE 3 TO OPTION-SORT
038600     ELSE
038700     IF OPTION-REPORT = 78
038800        MOVE 4 TO WHICH-REPORT
              MOVE 3 TO OPTION-SORT
038900     ELSE
039000     MOVE 1 TO WHICH-REPORT.
039100
039200*----------  PRINT HEADER PAGE
039400     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
039500        MOVE "DHDR75.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME
039600     ELSE
039700        IF FINDING-BLANK-DATES
039800           MOVE "DHDR77.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME
039900        ELSE
040000           MOVE "DHDR78.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME.
037700     OPEN OUTPUT PRT-FILE.
040100     CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME,
040200        FNUM, HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
040300     IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
040400          NEXT SENTENCE
040500     ELSE
040600         WRITE PRT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
040700         WRITE PRT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
040800     IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
040900         DISPLAY "THDRPT ERROR".
041100
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR-I DVENDITM-I DDESC-I MBUYER-I.

041200*----------  SET UP HEADING LITERALS FOR REPORT
041300     MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
041400     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
041500     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT                 TO HEAD2-DATE.
041600     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
041700        MOVE "Q U O T E   E X P I R A T I O N   R E P O R T"
041800              TO HEAD1-TITLE
041900         MOVE "  QR4 - " TO HEAD2-PROGRAM
042000     ELSE
042100        IF FINDING-BLANK-DATES
042200           MOVE "B L A N K   E X P I R A T I O N   D A T E S  "
042300                 TO HEAD1-TITLE
042400            MOVE "  QR6 - " TO HEAD2-PROGRAM
042500        ELSE
042600           IF FINDING-BLANK-QUOTE-NUM
042700               MOVE "  QR7 - " TO HEAD2-PROGRAM
042800             MOVE "B L A N K   Q U O T E   N U M B E R S        "
042900                   TO HEAD1-TITLE.
043000     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC.
043100     MOVE "PAGE " TO HEAD2-PAGE.
043200     MOVE PAGE-NUM    TO HEAD2-PAGE-NO.
043300
043400     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
043500        MOVE "for   " TO HEAD3-FOR
043600        MOVE OPTION-DAYS TO HEAD3-DAYS-NUM
043700        MOVE "   days" TO HEAD3-DAYS.
043800
043900     MOVE "    QUOTE    " TO HEAD4-QUOTE.
044000     MOVE "EXPIRATION  "  TO HEAD4-EXP.
044100     MOVE "VENDOR CODE"   TO HEAD4-VENCODE.
044200     MOVE "BUYER CODE"    TO HEAD4-BUYER-CODE.
044300     MOVE "CORPORATE CODE" TO HEAD4-CORP.
044400     MOVE "PRICE      "    TO HEAD4-PRICE.
044500
044600     MOVE "    NUMBER"     TO HEAD5-NUMBER.
044700     MOVE "      DATE"     TO HEAD5-DATE.
044800     MOVE "     VENDOR NAME"  TO HEAD5-VEN-NAME.
044900     MOVE "BUYER NAME"        TO HEAD5-BUYER-NAME.
045000     MOVE "DESCRIPTION"       TO HEAD5-DESC.
045100     MOVE "UM        "        TO HEAD5-UM.
045200     MOVE ALL "=" TO H6-DASH1, H6-DASH2, H6-DASH3,
045300                     H6-DASH4, H6-DASH5, H6-DASH6.
045400
045500     MOVE SPACES TO DATE-COMPARE.
045600
045700     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO CUR-DATE.
           IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              GO TO 199-EXIT.
045800
037100*----------  COMPUTE TODAYS JULIAN DATE AND ADD THIS TO
037200*            THE NUMBER OF DAYS THE REPORT IS TO COVER.
           MOVE SPACES          TO  JULGREG-PARMS.
           MOVE CUR-DATE        TO  GREG-YMD.
           IF GREG-YY > "70"
              MOVE "19"         TO  GREG-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "20"         TO  GREG-CC.
           CALL "JULGREG"  USING    GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                    DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
038200     MOVE JULIAN-DATE     TO  TODAYS-JULIAN, DATE-WANTED-JULIAN.
038300     ADD OPTION-DAYS, TJ-DDD GIVING DW-DDD.

       105-COMPUTE-DATE-WANTED.
038400     IF DW-DDD > 365
              SUBTRACT 365 FROM DW-DDD
              ADD 1 TO DW-CCYY
              GO TO 105-COMPUTE-DATE-WANTED.
           MOVE SPACES TO JULGREG-PARMS.
038500     MOVE DATE-WANTED-JULIAN    TO JULIAN-DATE.
038600
039600*----------  CHANGE THE JULIAN DATE INTO YYMMDD
           CALL "JULGREG"  USING    GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                    DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
           MOVE GREG-DATE             TO DATE-COMPARE.
049200 199-EXIT.  EXIT.
049300*************************************************************
049400*    FIND ALL QUOTES IN DVENDITM BY SEARCHING FOR A QUOTE   *
049500*    TAG OF "Q".  THEN COMPARE THE QUOTE EXPIRATION DATE    *
049600*    WITH THE COMPARE DATE TO SEE IF THE QUOTE WILL EXPIRE  *
049700*    BEFORE THE COMPARE DATE.                               *
049800*************************************************************
049900 200-PROCESS-QUOTES SECTION.
050000 200-FIND-ALL-QUOTES.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDITM-I FIRST INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
050700     PERFORM 205-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP THRU 290-EXIT
050800         UNTIL ALL-INPUT-RECORDS-PROCESSED.
050900
051000 205-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
051300     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
051400        MOVE "Y" TO END-OF-INPUT-FILE
051500        GO TO 290-EXIT.
051900     IF VEN-QUOTE-FLAG NOT = "Q"
052000        GO TO 210-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP.
052100
052200*-----  TEST IF THIS ENTRY IS WANTED DEPENDING ON WHICH
052300*            REPORT IS BEING PROCESSED.
052400     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
052500        IF VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE-CN > DATE-COMPARE OR = SPACES
052600           GO TO 210-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP
052700        ELSE
052800           NEXT SENTENCE
052900     ELSE
053000        IF FINDING-BLANK-DATES
053100           IF VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE = SPACES
053200              NEXT SENTENCE
053300           ELSE
053400              GO TO 210-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP
053500     ELSE
053600        IF FINDING-BLANK-QUOTE-NUM
053700           IF VEN-QUOTE-NUM = SPACES
053800              NEXT SENTENCE
053900           ELSE
054000              GO TO 210-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP.
054100
054200     MOVE VEN-ITM-VENCODE       TO SORT-VENCODE.
054300     MOVE VEN-ITM-CORPCODE      TO SORT-CORPCODE.
054400     MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE         TO SORT-PRICE.
054500     MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE-UM      TO SORT-UM.
054600     MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE-CN TO SORT-EXP-DATE-CN.
054700     MOVE VEN-QUOTE-NUM         TO SORT-QUOTE.
054800     MOVE VEN-BUYER-CODE        TO SORT-BUYER.
054900     RELEASE SORT-REC.
       210-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDITM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
055000     GO TO 205-READ-DVENDITM-LOOP.
055100 290-EXIT.  EXIT.
055200 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
055300 300-PRINT-REPORT SECTION 02.
055400 300-IS-FILE-EMPTY.
055500     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC.
055600     RETURN SORT-FILE
055700            AT END
055800               MOVE "Y" TO END-OF-SORT-FILE
055900               PERFORM 340-PRT-HEADINGS THRU 349-EXIT
056000               MOVE "0 RECORDS FOUND FOR THIS REPORT" TO
056100                               HEAD1-TITLE
056200               WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD1-TITLE
056300                    AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
056400               GO TO 399-EXIT.
056500
056600     MOVE "??????????" TO SAVE-QUOTE.
056700     PERFORM 302-FIND-REST-OF-DATA THRU 320-EXIT
056800          UNTIL ALL-SORTED-RECORDS-PROCESSED.
056900     GO TO 399-EXIT.
057000 302-FIND-REST-OF-DATA.
057100
057200     IF LINE-CTR > 60
057300        PERFORM 340-PRT-HEADINGS THRU 349-EXIT.
057400
057500*-----  FILL IN FIRST DATA LINE
057600     MOVE SPACES                TO LINE1.
057700     MOVE SORT-CORPCODE         TO LINE1-CORP-CODE.
057800     MOVE SORT-PRICE            TO LINE1-PRICE.
057900     IF FINDING-BLANK-QUOTE-NUM
058000        NEXT SENTENCE
058100     ELSE
058200     IF SORT-QUOTE = SAVE-QUOTE
058300        GO TO 303-UNIQUE-DATA.
058400     MOVE SORT-QUOTE            TO LINE1-QUOTE.
058500     MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE.
058600     IF SORT-EXP-DATE NOT = SPACES
058700        MOVE SORT-EXP-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
058800        CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, ESC-NAME
058900        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO LINE1-EXP-DATE.
059000
059100     IF SORT-EFFECT-DATE NOT = SPACES
059200        MOVE SORT-EFFECT-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
059300        CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, ESC-NAME
059400        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO LINE1-EFFECT-DATE.
059500     MOVE SORT-VENCODE          TO LINE1-VEN-CODE.
059600     MOVE SORT-BUYER            TO LINE1-BUYER-CODE.
059700 303-UNIQUE-DATA.
059800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM LINE1 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
059900     ADD 1 TO LINE-CTR.
060000
060100*----------  FILL IN SECOND DATA LINE
060200     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC, LINE2.
060300     IF FINDING-BLANK-QUOTE-NUM
060400        NEXT SENTENCE
060500     ELSE
060600     IF SORT-QUOTE = SAVE-QUOTE
060700        GO TO 309-FIND-DESCRIPTION
060800     ELSE
060900        MOVE SORT-QUOTE TO SAVE-QUOTE.
061000     MOVE SORT-VENCODE TO VEN-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE VEN-ARG TO VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I.
           START DVENDOR-I KEY = VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
061300     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
061400        MOVE "DBFIND DVENDOR AT 305 IN TQUOTEXP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
061500        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
061600
061700 305-GET-VENDOR-NAME.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDOR-I NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I NOT = VEN-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
062000     IF END-OF-CHAIN
062100        MOVE "WARNING - NO VENDOR NAME!!!!" TO LINE2-VEN-NAME
062200        MOVE "*" TO LINE2-ERROR
062300        GO TO 307-GET-BUYER.
062400     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
062500        MOVE "DBGET FAILED AT 305 IN TQUOTEXP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
062600        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
062700
062800     IF VEN-ITM-NO NOT = 00
062900        GO TO 305-GET-VENDOR-NAME.
063000     MOVE VEN-ITM-DATA                 TO LINE2-VEN-NAME.
063100 307-GET-BUYER.
063200     MOVE SORT-BUYER TO BUYER-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE BUYER-ARG TO BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-REC-I.
           READ MBUYER-I INTO BUF-MBUYER
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
063500     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
063600        MOVE "WARNING - NO BUYER NAME!!!!" TO LINE2-BUYER-NAME
063700        MOVE "*" TO LINE2-ERROR
063800        GO TO 309-FIND-DESCRIPTION.
063900     MOVE BUYER-NAME TO LINE2-BUYER-NAME.
064000
064100 309-FIND-DESCRIPTION.
064200     IF SORT-CORPCODE = "NON-STR"
064300        GO TO 315-GET-UM.
064400     MOVE SORT-CORPCODE TO CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I.
           START DDESC-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
064700     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
064800        MOVE "DBFIND DDESC AT 305 IN TQUOTEXP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
064900        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
065000
065100 310-GET-DESCRIPTION.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DDESC-I NEXT INTO BUF-DDESC
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
065400     IF END-OF-CHAIN
065500        MOVE "WARNING - NO DESCRIPTION!!!!" TO LINE2-DESC
065600        MOVE "*" TO LINE2-ERROR
065700        GO TO 315-GET-UM.
065800     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
065900        MOVE "NO DESC AT 310 IN TQUOTEXP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
066000        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
066100
066200     IF DESC-ID-NUM NOT = "00"
066300        GO TO 310-GET-DESCRIPTION.
066400     MOVE DESC-DATA TO LINE2-DESC.
066500
066600 315-GET-UM.
066700     MOVE SORT-UM TO LINE2-UM.
066800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM LINE2 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
066900     ADD 1 TO LINE-CTR.
067000
067100     RETURN SORT-FILE
067200            AT END   MOVE "Y" TO END-OF-SORT-FILE
067300                     GO TO 320-EXIT.
067400 320-EXIT.  EXIT.
067500*----------  PRINT HEADINGS
067600 340-PRT-HEADINGS.
067700     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC.
067800     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING NEWPAGE.
067900     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
068000        MOVE "Q U O T E   E X P I R A T I O N   R E P O R T"
068100              TO HEAD1-TITLE
068200     ELSE
068300        IF FINDING-BLANK-DATES
068400           MOVE "B L A N K   E X P I R A T I O N   D A T E S  "
068500                 TO HEAD1-TITLE
068600        ELSE
068700           IF FINDING-BLANK-QUOTE-NUM
068800             MOVE "B L A N K   Q U O T E   N U M B E R S        "
068900                   TO HEAD1-TITLE.
069000     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD1 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
069100     MOVE "  QR2 - " TO HEAD2-PROGRAM.
069300     MOVE "PAGE " TO HEAD2-PAGE.
069400     MOVE PAGE-NUM    TO HEAD2-PAGE-NO.
069500     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD2 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
069600
069700     IF FINDING-EXPIRED-QUOTES
069800        MOVE "for   " TO HEAD3-FOR
069900        MOVE OPTION-DAYS TO HEAD3-DAYS-NUM
070000        MOVE "   days" TO HEAD3-DAYS.
070100     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD3 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
070200
070300     MOVE "    QUOTE    " TO HEAD4-QUOTE.
070400     MOVE "EXPIRATION  "  TO HEAD4-EXP.
070500     MOVE "VENDOR CODE"   TO HEAD4-VENCODE.
070600     MOVE "BUYER CODE"    TO HEAD4-BUYER-CODE.
070700     MOVE "CORPORATE CODE" TO HEAD4-CORP.
070800     MOVE "PRICE      "    TO HEAD4-PRICE.
070900     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD4 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
071000
071100     MOVE "    NUMBER"     TO HEAD5-NUMBER.
071200     MOVE "      DATE"     TO HEAD5-DATE.
071300     MOVE "     VENDOR NAME"  TO HEAD5-VEN-NAME.
071400     MOVE "BUYER NAME"        TO HEAD5-BUYER-NAME.
071500     MOVE "DESCRIPTION"       TO HEAD5-DESC.
071600     MOVE "UM        "        TO HEAD5-UM.
071700     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEAD5 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
071800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HDR-6 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
071900
072000     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC.
072100     WRITE PRT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
072200     ADD 1 TO PAGE-NUM.
072300     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC.
072400     MOVE 10 TO LINE-CTR.
072500
072600 349-EXIT.  EXIT.
072700 399-EXIT.  EXIT.
       ERROR-ROUTINES SECTION.
       COPY OVRPFCALL IN COPYLIB.
074000************************************************************
074200 990-BLOWUP.
074300     MOVE "TQUOTEXP" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE SORT-QUOTE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE SORT-CORPCODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
074400     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
074500           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
074600           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
074700 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
